      <VERS vnumber="2"> As a <gr str="5650">servant </gr>earnestly <gr str="7602">desireth </gr>the <gr str="6738">shadow</gr>, and as a <gr str="7916">hireling </gr>looketh <gr str="6960">for </gr>
