      <VERS vnumber="20"> I have <gr str="2398">sinned</gr>; <gr str="4100">what </gr>shall I <gr str="6466">do </gr>unto thee, O thou <gr str="5341">preserver </gr>of <gr str="120">men</gr>? <gr str="4100">why </gr>hast thou <gr str="7760">set </gr>me as a <gr str="4645">mark </gr>against thee, so that I <gr str="1861">am </gr>a <gr str="4853">burden </gr>
